{"videoSource":"human3-reference/avatar.mp4","captions":[{"startFrame":0,"endFrame":100,"text":"你是否想过让一个数字分身替你出镜，"},{"startFrame":100,"endFrame":150,"text":"而且还能用你自己的声音说话？"},{"startFrame":200,"endFrame":250,"text":"AI-Remotion 就是帮你实现这个想法的工具。"},{"startFrame":275,"endFrame":350,"text":"你只需要提供一小段你的真实声音，"},{"startFrame":350,"endFrame":425,"text":"录音系统会学习你声音的特点，"},{"startFrame":450,"endFrame":450,"text":"音色、"},{"startFrame":450,"endFrame":475,"text":"语调、"},{"startFrame":475,"endFrame":500,"text":"说话节奏，"},{"startFrame":500,"endFrame":525,"text":"生成一个高度接近你本人的"},{"startFrame":525,"endFrame":575,"text":"AI 声音模型。"},{"startFrame":625,"endFrame":625,"text":"同时，"},{"startFrame":625,"endFrame":775,"text":"你可以选择或创建自己的数字人形象上传照片或简单设置，"},{"startFrame":775,"endFrame":825,"text":"就能得到一个长相、表情"},{"startFrame":825,"endFrame":900,"text":"都像你的虚拟角色之后，"},{"startFrame":900,"endFrame":950,"text":"你输入文字，AI-Remotion"},{"startFrame":975,"endFrame":1025,"text":"就会让这个数字人用你的声音说出来，"},{"startFrame":1050,"endFrame":1150,"text":"口型表情都会自动同步想试试。"},{"startFrame":1150,"endFrame":1175,"text":"在评论区留言，"},{"startFrame":1200,"endFrame":1250,"text":"数字人我们会把体验方式发给你，"},{"startFrame":1275,"endFrame":1275,"text":"关注我们，"},{"startFrame":1300,"endFrame":1325,"text":"了解更多 a i 创作技巧。"}],"durationInFrames":1355}